    <string name="uv_index_about">Ɣef umatar n yisallan n yiṭij</string>
    <string name="uv_index_about_description">Amhaz n yiṭij yeshelǧay tazmert n yiṭij (tiftilin yettwannisnin). Ma yella yuli umaz, d win ara yerran aɣbel n uquṛḥ n tfekka (tizi), aṭṭan n lehlak n uglim (serṭan) d uɛeggu n tiṭṭawin d win yettnernin s lemɣawla.</string>
    <string name="uv_index_scale">Aswir n wamhaz n yiṭij</string>
    <string name="uv_index_time_to_burn">Akud n uquṛḥ</string>
    <string name="uv_index_time_to_burn_explanations">Akud uɣrid n uquṛḥ yegdel ɣef teɣzi (altitude), lqaɛa yettafen am aman neɣ adfel, ṣṣifa n uglim-inek, d useqdec n uɣdid n yiṭij.</string>
    <string name="uv_alert_level">Alal</string>
    <string name="air_quality_index_short">ATA</string>
    <string name="air_quality_index_about">Γef wswir n teẓdi n waḍu</string>
    <string name="air_quality_index_about_description_1">Aswir n teẓdi n waḍu (ATA) d amhaz yettwassenulfan akken ad ak-yeǧǧ ad tfehmeḍ amek i teẓẓa teẓdi n waḍu deg kra n lǧiha, d yiblaḍen izemren ad awḍen taafsa-inek.</string>
    <string name="air_quality_index_about_description_2">Aswir yettuseqdacen deg usnas-agi yebedd ɣef yisumar n Tuddsa Taɣelnawt n Tezmert (WHO), mačči ɣef yilugan n tmurt, akken ad yili wazal n tfulyin d yiluɣa yelhan, yerna ad yehwu usemsawi n teẓdi n waḍu gar tmura.</string>
    <string name="air_quality_index_scale">Aswir n wamhaz n teẓdi n waḍu</string>
    <string name="air_quality_index_harmless_exposure">Afsar ur nelli d uɣris</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_1_description">Teẓdi n waḍu telha nezzeh i teɣzi n wemdan; zemreḍ ad tsekneḍ tiwuriwin-ik timezwura n berra.</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_1_harmless_exposure">Asggas 1</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_2_description">Teẓdi n waḍu telha s umata i waṭas n yimdanen. Lameɛna, wid iɣef tbedd tezmert s wudem ur nqubil zemren ad ḥussen s kra n waṭṭanen imecṭuḥen neɣ imectahen seg ufsar uɛlayan.</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_2_harmless_exposure">Asggas 1</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_3_description">Teẓdi n waḍu tewweḍ ɣer yiwen n uswir uɛlayan n tɣuri, yerna ur telhi ara i wid yellan s tezmert ur nqubil. Nqes lweqt i tɛeddiḍ berra ma yella tḥusseḍ s kra n yizmal am ugur n tnefsit neɣ tuccḍa n ṭjur.</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_3_harmless_exposure">Tazzla n wussan &lt; 1</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_4">Ur nqebli ara</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_4_description">Akk n tezmert zemren ad ttwaxeddmen srid i wid iɣef tbedd tezmert. Wid yellan d iɛlayanen zemren ad ḥussen s wuguren n tnefsit d tuccḍa n ṭjur mi ara ɛeddin lweqt ɣef beṛṛa. Beddel neɣ nqes tiwuriwin-ik n beṛṛa.</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_4_harmless_exposure">S phiz &lt; 1</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_5">Ur yelhi nezzeh</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_5_description">Iɣbula n tezmert zemren ad ttwaxeddmen srid i wid iɣef tbedd tezmert, yerna iwata ad ǧǧen tiwuriwin n beṛṛa. Wid yellan d iɛlayanen zemren ad ḥussen s wuguren n tnefsit d tuccḍa n ṭjur; ɣileɣ ad qqimen deg uxxam neɣ ad sserksen tiwuriwin-nni n beṛṛa.</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_5_harmless_exposure">Kra n tesdatin</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_6">Imarik</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_6_description">Afsar akk n waḍu, ula d kra kan n tesdatin, izmer ad yawi ɣer tegnit n tezmert tawaɣit i yal yiwen. Ǧǧeḍ tiwuriwin n beṛṛa.</string>
    <string name="air_quality_level_6_harmless_exposure">Tesεiwt 1</string>
