    <string name="pressure_about">Γef uɣbel</string>
    <string name="pressure_about_description1">Aɣbel n tegnit d aɣbel n wadda i d-yeṭṭafaren seg tegnit n wakal. Asnas-agi yessqedac aɣbel n tegnit n tlisa n yill (MSLP) akken ad yezmer yiwen ad yessemsawi aɣbel gar yimukan yesɛan tiɣziwin yemgaraden s lqelleɛ.</string>
    <string name="pressure_about_description2">Imedyazen imeqqranen yerna ɣezzifen di uɣbel ttwaseqdacen akken ad nɛasseḍ ibeddilen n tegnit. Amedya, aɣelluy n uɣbel yezmer ad d-yini d akken aɣli n waman neɣ n udfel qrib ad d-yawweḍ, ma d asali n uɣbel yezmer ad d-yini d akken tegnit ad teḥfu. Aɣbel n tegnit aramay yezmer ad d-yawi iɣimiwen n uqjun (icebban n uqjun), leɛtab n yizuran, leɛya d waṭas n wammaken nniḍen.</string>
